// "Cleave {1}{U}{U} / Counter target spell [that wasn't cast from its owner's
// hand]." [CR#702.148a,701.6a]: the bracketed words are written in place, and
// paying the cleave cost removes them [CR#612.1]. "Its owner's hand" is the
// bare hand zone, as a move's `hand` destination is the owner's: a predicate
// has no pronoun for its own member.
SingleFaced(face: (
    characteristics: (
        name: "Wash Away",
        cost: [Blue],
        types: [Instant],
        text: [
            cleave(mana([1, Blue, Blue])),
            spell(counter(target(and([spell, bracketed(not(castFrom(hand)))])))),
        ],
    ),
))
